{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"5601d61b-8278-467d-bac0-28ef2d40c2f1","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"state-transition","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:21:58.186Z","from":"BASELINING","to":"ANALYZING","reason":null}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"c78e7e7c-d534-4317-a9b4-ae509414ee81","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:44:44.314Z","conclusion":{"id":"981fef2a-c2be-43c0-8efb-622311af1933","status":"PROVEN","text":"宿主Codex身份兼容链路存在现行缺陷：run.mjs对Codex总是采集environment，但status.mjs的--cli路径调用cliIdentity时不采集environment，随后与协议做深比较，因此新v4宿主Codex的status --cli会误报DRIVER_MISMATCH并阻断续跑预览；旧v4协议的driverIdentity没有environment，run --resume又会把新environment放进frozen协议并在experiment.mjs中拒绝冻结协议不一致。当前测试只覆盖无environment的模拟/旧身份，未覆盖新Codex身份的status和resume。","evidence":["benchmarks/run.mjs:38；benchmarks/status.mjs:62,67；benchmarks/experiment.mjs:43-49,71-89；.ai-harness/work-items/MODEL-PROJECT-V2-STRUCTURED-20261014/project-v2-comparison/protocol.json:105-112；benchmarks/README.md:71,188-191；benchmarks/tests/status.test.mjs:37,204-209；benchmarks/tests/memory-control.test.mjs:32-44"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"e43d455d-92a1-4e6c-bf1f-e30abca84ef0","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:45:01.747Z","conclusion":{"id":"64a2b6e5-0876-4fff-a674-1e0e2622cc8b","status":"INFERRED","text":"Docker试次在Linux宿主上很可能无法写入participant工作区：runner.mjs用mkdtemp创建工作区，Node默认临时目录权限通常是仅所有者可访问；codex-container.mjs却把容器固定为65534:65534并把该目录作为可写bind挂载，代码没有chmod、chown、用户映射或权限探测。于是模型可能不能读取/修改/workspace，也不能写output中的final.json和事件文件。当前Docker测试只mock Docker inspect，不会暴露真实宿主权限问题。","evidence":["benchmarks/runner.mjs:26-29,77-84,187-203；benchmarks/codex-container.mjs:10,46-56,81-88；benchmarks/tests/container-driver.test.mjs:29-39,62-106"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"fb9c8abf-bb42-49ba-9ceb-ae975814a0d4","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:45:20.085Z","conclusion":{"id":"b65952a9-7951-4b0b-9efd-51e797f7a0c1","status":"PROVEN","text":"Docker runtime没有真实provider接入路径：容器创建固定--network none，run.mjs未提供endpoint/socket/凭据注入，codex-driver只向容器传递模型参数和prompt，且容器内关闭MCP、web及外部工具。除非镜像自行内置一个可用的本地provider，否则正式run命令不能完成常规远端模型会话；当前代码实际更接近离线/本地模拟隔离探针，而不是可直接运行的真实benchmark runtime。","evidence":["benchmarks/codex-container.mjs:67,81-88；benchmarks/codex-driver.mjs:21-27,35-42；benchmarks/run.mjs:21-41；benchmarks/README.md:21-29,49-51"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"eb89a62e-1915-4270-84b0-f47090825a89","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:45:38.356Z","conclusion":{"id":"5edc9317-2fbe-40a3-8753-7fa0b9017601","status":"PROVEN","text":"容器身份测量重复次数与文档承诺不一致：containerIdentity每次调用都会创建、inspect、start并rm一个identity容器；loadContainerRuntime首次调用一次，runtime.prepare每个试次前再次调用，experiment.runExperiment的identityReader又在每次加载/试次前后调用。文档却说明相同image ID不重复运行identity容器。多试次实验会产生大量额外Docker生命周期操作，且这些准备/重验时间不受模型试次预算约束。","evidence":["benchmarks/codex-container.mjs:62-70,77-88,93；benchmarks/experiment.mjs:72-89,113-123；benchmarks/README.md:51"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"cd1e25c8-a5c6-431e-8bcf-ff32c25e62ef","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:45:56.854Z","conclusion":{"id":"d18db0c2-95dc-4c4e-b9f7-bde51b1a5afc","status":"INFERRED","text":"v4审计与运行/恢复校验不一致：audit.mjs只做schema、计划、任务、结果和汇总的局部检查，没有调用experiment.mjs的validateExperimentProtocol；execution.mjs也只校验协议哈希、schedule和trial字段。因此v4 protocol缺失或伪造driverIdentity时，若同步保持execution/summary/results内部一致，审计路径可能仍返回valid，而status和resume路径会拒绝。现有删除driverIdentity的负测试只把协议降为v2/v3，未覆盖v4。","evidence":["benchmarks/audit.mjs:11-18,23-38,56-61；benchmarks/execution.mjs:12-29；benchmarks/experiment.mjs:52-60；benchmarks/tests/runner.test.mjs:292-314；benchmarks/tests/multifile.test.mjs:246-267"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"60eadc28-ec6e-4a67-bd33-c7a46ef16b1f","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:46:34.274Z","conclusion":{"id":"4721a0b8-2065-441b-9b04-55c605557ea7","status":"PROVEN","text":"\"内存隔离准入尚未形成跨平台闭环：preflight.mjs在非Windows直接把filesystemProbe标为unavailable，而memoryPreflightReady要求externalDenied、memoryDenied和sandboxStateUnchanged等文件系统布尔检查全部为true；因此Linux/amd64","evidence":["\"benchmarks/preflight.mjs:21-27,81-89；benchmarks/run.mjs:21-41；benchmarks/README.md:73-83；.ai-harness/work-items/ITER-MEMORY-PREFLIGHT-20261015/summary.md:3,26,52\""]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"4a7e699a-6ccc-4b63-a0fa-5ac497878cce","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:48:15.460Z","conclusion":{"id":"20730883-1b85-4678-a904-1bd84142cf10","status":"PROVEN","text":"内存隔离准入尚未形成跨平台闭环：preflight.mjs在非Windows直接把filesystemProbe标为unavailable，而memoryPreflightReady要求externalDenied、memoryDenied和sandboxStateUnchanged等文件系统布尔检查全部为true；因此Linux/amd64 Docker路径没有机会得到ready=true。当前Docker runtime也没有调用preflight或提供等价的容器专用ready门禁，现有memory preflight记录仍是ready=false。","evidence":["benchmarks/preflight.mjs:21-27,81-89；benchmarks/run.mjs:21-41；benchmarks/README.md:73-83；.ai-harness/work-items/ITER-MEMORY-PREFLIGHT-20261015/summary.md:3,26,52"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"35e44f2d-1f94-4456-9671-e00c1eb89434","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:48:48.016Z","conclusion":{"id":"fb629105-ac03-44b2-9e2f-9a139bb75bd9","status":"UNKNOWN","text":"Docker runtime的真实可用性仍未知：当前CI只运行benchmarks/tests中的mock Docker handler和Node 20/22/24源码测试，没有固定Codex镜像、Linux bind权限、真实容器内CLI、provider或MCP链路；HEAD 78c978b的两个workflow虽已远端9/9成功，但不能外推上述路径。","evidence":[".github/workflows/ai-harness.yml:12-31；.github/workflows/source-tests.yml:12-40；benchmarks/tests/container-driver.test.mjs:29-39,62-181；.ai-harness/work-items/ITER-CONTAINER-CODEX-DRIVER-20261015/summary.md:3-7"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"b43bb0a9-741a-433c-bf1f-fb0dae654c8f","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-CURRENT-ISSUES-20261016","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-10-16T01:49:02.303Z","conclusion":{"id":"29e4b8d5-4549-4775-9855-3c955bccda0a","status":"PROVEN","text":"发布元数据没有跟随HEAD的新功能：README和.ai-harness/manifest.json仍报告当前版本1.11.0，README的1.11.0变更说明也没有容器化Codex runtime；但HEAD 78c978b已新增Docker runtime、CLI参数、协议身份和文档。安装/版本诊断无法仅凭版本号判断是否包含这项能力，发布记录也不完整。","evidence":["README.md:5,31-33；.ai-harness/manifest.json:3；git show HEAD --format= -- benchmarks/codex-container.mjs benchmarks/run.mjs benchmarks/README.md"]}}
